; ============================================================================
; $025110 stage-2 guarded compact collision pass.
;
; At h25110_stage1_done the retained 68K lowering would walk two outer records
; ($3A54/$3A64) against 32 inner records ($3A74-$3C64).  The settled gameplay
; shape has a positive first outer, a nonpositive second outer, and at most
; sixteen qualifying inners.  Prove those facts with exact signed rectangle
; comparisons.  Non-overlaps remain read-only; overlaps continue in the
; bounded $9D:E800 response body, which reproduces the original response-byte
; and type-propagation writes before returning to this same scan.  Any shape
; miss restarts the byte-retained stage-2 setup before its first write.
;
; On a hit, stage 2 has no game-state writes.  Recreate the exhausted D5/D6/A1
; loop state, preserve D1/X, materialize the D0.W value left by the final
; qualifying reject, and enter the original stage-3 setup.  This is bounded
; function-local acceleration, not an end-to-end performance claim.
; ============================================================================
h25110_stage2_try:
    rep #$30
    .a16
    .i16

    ; Outer 0 must execute and outer 1 must take its initial BLE skip.  Other
    ; shapes retain the complete generated loop.
    ldx #$3A54
    lda $400000,x
